---
// 名單中的一個人：有頭像用頭像，沒有就用字母徽章（品牌漸層＋Logo 光點）。
import type { Person } from '../../../graph';

interface Props {
  person: Person;
}
const { person } = Astro.props;
const hash = [...person.id].reduce((h, c) => (h * 31 + c.charCodeAt(0)) >>> 0, 7);
const initial = (Array.from(person.name.trim())[0] ?? '?').toUpperCase();
const Tag = person.github ? 'a' : 'span';
---

<Tag
  class="cr-person"
  href={person.github ? `https://github.com/${encodeURIComponent(person.github)}` : undefined}
  rel={person.github ? 'noopener' : undefined}
>
  {
    person.avatar ? (
      <span class="cr-av">
        <img src={person.avatar} alt="" width="56" height="56" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </span>
    ) : (
      <span class="cr-av is-initial" style={`--a:${(hash % 120) + 110}deg`} aria-hidden="true">
        {initial}
      </span>
    )
  }
  <span class="cr-name">{person.name}</span>
</Tag>
